<title>LEBANON: Lebanon trade deficit $562 mln in November 96.</title>
<headline>Lebanon trade deficit $562 mln in November 96.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lebanon's trade deficit was $562 million in November compared with $602 million in October and $483 million in November 1995, customs figures showed.</p>
<p>    MERCHANDISE TRADE	Nov  96     Oct  96     Nov  95</p>
<p>Monthly</p>
<p>    Exports		    100.0	  91.0	  73.0</p>
<p>    Imports		    662.0	 693.0	 556.0</p>
<p>    Trade balance	   -562.0	-602.0	-483.0</p>
<p>Year-to-date</p>
<p>    Exports		    933.0	 833.0	 737.0</p>
<p>    Imports		  6,812.0     6,150.0     6,657.0</p>
<p>    Trade balance	 -5,879.0    -5,317.0    -5,920.0</p>
<p>Note - Figures in millions of U.S. dollars. -- Beirut newsroom (961 1) 602057 745307 745308</p>
</text>
